      "content": "it's such a relief to hear you say that. everyone else just tells me to \"hold on\" or \"fight it,\" but they don't understand that fighting it just means fighting to become someone I hate. if you really think it's a mercy, then how do you think someone like me should even begin to approach it? how do you make sure it's peaceful and stays dignified?",
